107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (The rapid growth of e-commerce has increased the number of parcels processed in fulfillment centers every day. During handling and transportation, packages may get damaged due to improper stacking, impacts, or environmental conditions. Manual inspection is often slow and inaccurate, making it difficult to detect damaged parcels efficiently. This project proposes an Automated Parcel Damage Detection System that uses computer vision and deep learning to identify damaged packages in real time, improving quality control and reducing customer complaints.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
