111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (E-commerce fulfillment centers process thousands of parcels daily, making manual inspection difficult and unreliable. Human inspectors may miss damaged packages due to fatigue and high conveyor belt speeds, resulting in damaged products reaching customers. This leads to increased returns, financial losses, and reduced customer satisfaction. Therefore, an automated system is needed to accurately detect parcel damage in real time and support efficient quality control.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
